1. She is not a morning person and has difficulty waking up. (Verbatim: "if i'm ever late or you're like where the heck is earlier it's it's most 1000 likely i'm asleep and i've failed my alarms and that is because i am not a morning person")

2. She sleeps very deeply and is hard to wake up, even to loud noises or emergencies. (Verbatim: "i sleep like a log i feel like my place could be on fire i could get robbed i don't know and i would not wake up i am pretty resilient to noises or anything when it comes to waking me up")

3. She needs to set multiple alarms to wake up successfully. (Verbatim: "i have to set multiple alarms i wish i was joking but i am just yeah")

4. She tends to be grumpy when first waking up. (Verbatim: "i've been told i was a little on the grumpy side when when when i wake up with it i i i quite i'm quite grumpy here")

5. She regularly streams at both 9 AM and 9 PM to accommodate different time zones. (Verbatim: "the reason why there's so many by the way if you're wondering um isn't just because i'm like i can want to spend all time all my time with you all um it's because um it's because it's because it's because i don't like time zones time zones are my enemy and i try to cover both time zones")

6. She prefers dark mode on her PC and finds light mode visually jarring. (Verbatim: "everything is dark mode except for activity feed chan has embraced light mode um it's like it stands out so much and i can't change it and it won't it won't it won't go back to dark mode and it's just so heck and bright")

7. She uses OBS for streaming and highly recommends it over other software. (Verbatim: "i don't use stream labs otherwise i use obs because if you're a streamer i highly highly highly highly highly highly highly highly highly highly recommend you swap to obs you have to i'm sorry like obs is is just it's it's superior")

8. Her chat interface is YouTube chat set as a browser source with custom CSS. (Verbatim: "for chat um that's actually just youtube chat um set as a browser source with custom css")

9. She has two mascot candidates named "Stana" and "Stanana" and holds monthly elections for fans to choose. (Verbatim: "we have two mascots we have and we have and typically we do a election each month... you can pick whichever one you want to be okay if you want to be a starting you could be a starting if you want to be a star nana be a star nana")

10. She previously streamed either in the morning or evening before debut, but now does both. (Verbatim: "prior to debut i was just doing either one or the other but now i'm doing both time zones") [end of text]



1. She has severe arachnophobia and gets unsettled by pictures of spiders. (Verbatim: "i have severe arachnophobia i get super unsettled by big pictures of spiders")
