3. She once destroyed an IKEA alarm clock by ripping off the bell part because she couldn’t turn it off. (Verbatim: "i ripped off the ding ding part that hits the bell because that was clearly the only solution")
4. She experienced extreme panic in the dark while trying to silence the alarm clock during her university days. (Verbatim: "i was so stressed i was so panicked it was so dark i was so like like worried i was like shut up")
5. She finds mobile alarms that run away from you to be an “absolute evil invention.” (Verbatim: "blake there are alarms that go mobile and run away from you till you catch it and shut it up absolute evil invention")
6. She once missed six alarms set for a 4 AM stream and felt terrible about it. (Verbatim: "i just missed six alarms for your stream at 4am the other day and i feel so bad i wanted to cry")
